  "cards": [
    {"dot": "cyan", "title": "The template", "items": [
      "A profile is one JSON file; extends merges another's tiles field by field, drop removes some (profiles.py 144–163, 175–193). check() fills the defaults and names the field of an error (profiles.py 113–141).",
      "Option also belongs to a choice tile directly (a scene, a room); a tiles command patches the shown profile the same way and checks it again (profiles.py 213–217)."]},
    {"dot": "amber", "title": "The edge's memory", "items": [
      "Nothing here is written to disk. A profile command empties states and labels (core.py 162–166); the phone's hello is cleared when it goes, states stay for the next one (core.py 138–152).",
      "Events keep their data with each photo replaced by its size; the JPEGs of the last 6 are kept apart for /api/photo (core.py 69–80, protocol.py 252–259)."]}
  ]
